{"title":"Career roadmap — Risk Analyst","role":"Risk Analyst","summary":"A Risk Analyst identifies, measures, monitors, and reports financial, operational, compliance, credit, fraud, and business risks. A B.Com in Forensic Accounting/Auditing is particularly suited to financial crime, fraud risk, internal controls, audit risk, operational risk, and compliance analytics.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Course":"B.Com – Forensic Accounting / Auditing"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Risk Analyst / Risk & Controls Associate; build accounting, audit, controls, Excel, SQL and risk fundamentals"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Senior Risk Analyst / Risk Specialist; specialise in financial, operational, credit or fraud risk"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Risk Manager / Risk Consulting Manager; own risk frameworks, analytics and controls"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Head of Risk / Enterprise Risk Leader / Chief Risk Officer track"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Accounting + risk foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial accounting"},{"text":"Cost accounting"},{"text":"Business economics"},{"text":"Business law"},{"text":"Auditing fundamentals"},{"text":"Corporate finance"},{"text":"Statistics and probability"},{"text":"Principles of risk management"},{"text":"Internal controls"},{"text":"Corporate governance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong Excel skills:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pivot tables"},{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"Conditional logic"},{"text":"Financial functions"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Charts and dashboards"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Mini-project","text":"Analyse a fictional company's financial statements and identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Liquidity risks"},{"text":"Leverage risks"},{"text":"Profitability risks"},{"text":"Cash-flow risks"},{"text":"Control weaknesses"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Audit + forensic accounting"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Forensic accounting"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fraud indicators"},{"text":"Fraud schemes"},{"text":"Financial statement manipulation"},{"text":"Revenue recognition risks"},{"text":"Expense manipulation"},{"text":"Asset misappropriation"},{"text":"Related-party transactions"},{"text":"Benford's Law"},{"text":"Duplicate transactions"},{"text":"Unusual journal entries"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Auditing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Audit evidence"},{"text":"Risk assessment"},{"text":"Materiality"},{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Internal controls"},{"text":"Control testing"},{"text":"Substantive testing"},{"text":"Audit documentation"},{"text":"Audit trails"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tools"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL fundamentals"},{"text":"Tally/ERP systems"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Project","text":"Build a Fraud Detection Dashboard that identifies:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Duplicate payments"},{"text":"Unusual transaction values"},{"text":"Weekend transactions"},{"text":"Round-number transactions"},{"text":"Suspicious vendors"},{"text":"Unusual employee expenses"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Risk analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Financial risk"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Liquidity risk"},{"text":"Market risk"},{"text":"Interest-rate risk"},{"text":"Foreign-exchange risk"},{"text":"Capital adequacy concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Credit risk"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Credit appraisal"},{"text":"Credit scoring"},{"text":"Probability of Default (PD)"},{"text":"Loss Given Default (LGD)"},{"text":"Exposure at Default (EAD)"},{"text":"Expected Loss"},{"text":"Debt-service ratios"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Operational risk"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Process failures"},{"text":"People risk"},{"text":"Technology risk"},{"text":"Cyber-related operational risk"},{"text":"Business continuity"},{"text":"Key Risk Indicators (KRIs)"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance risk"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AML"},{"text":"KYC"},{"text":"Sanctions concepts"},{"text":"Regulatory compliance"},{"text":"Transaction monitoring"},{"text":"Suspicious activity concepts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Also learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Python/pandas"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Data visualisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final year — Risk intelligence portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Build 2–3 strong projects."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Enterprise Risk Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Risk category"},{"text":"Risk probability"},{"text":"Risk impact"},{"text":"Risk score"},{"text":"Risk owner"},{"text":"Mitigation"},{"text":"Residual risk"},{"text":"KRI status"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Financial Fraud Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Use a transaction dataset to identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Duplicate transactions"},{"text":"Outliers"},{"text":"Benford-law anomalies"},{"text":"Vendor concentration"},{"text":"Unusual payment patterns"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Credit Risk Model"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a basic model using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Income"},{"text":"Debt"},{"text":"Credit history"},{"text":"Loan amount"},{"text":"Repayment behaviour"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Output:"},{"type":"h","text":"Low Risk / Medium Risk / High Risk"},{"type":"p","text":"Clearly document model limitations and avoid presenting a student model as a production lending decision system."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Core skills","Typical roles"],"rows":[[{"tex